{
  "id": "28225_gengaku",
  "headword": "{減額|げんがく}",
  "reading": "げんがく",
  "romaji": "gengaku",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "reduction; cut (in amount)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "reduction in amount; cutting (a sum)",
      "explanation": "Reducing a set sum of money such as a fee, salary, budget, or payment. The opposite of {増額|ぞうがく} (increasing an amount). Often used with する as a verb."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "28225_gengaku_ex1",
      "japanese": "{給料|きゅうりょう}が{減額|げんがく}された。",
      "english": "My salary was reduced.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28225_gengaku_ex2",
      "japanese": "{会費|かいひ}の{減額|げんがく}を{申|もう}し{出|で}た。",
      "english": "I requested a reduction in the membership fee.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28225_gengaku_ex3",
      "japanese": "{予算|よさん}の{減額|げんがく}によって、{計画|けいかく}の{一部|いちぶ}を{見直|みなお}すことになった。",
      "english": "Due to the budget cut, we had to revise part of the plan.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Used as a noun or with する ({減額|げんがく}する).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {給料|きゅうりょう}を{減額|げんがく}する: to cut a salary\n- {予算|よさん}の{減額|げんがく}: budget reduction\n- {大幅|おおはば}な{減額|げんがく}: a large reduction\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {増額|ぞうがく}: increase in amount — direct antonym\n- {削減|さくげん}: cutting back; curtailment — broader, applies to costs, staff, or emissions, not just a set monetary amount",
